WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.008
In the last years of Qin, war burned across the land; the fields lay desolate and the people suffered.

00:00:07.008 --> 00:00:15.672
Emperor Wen ascended the throne, wearing plain, simple clothes, and announced lighter taxes and labor service for the people.

00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:22.752
The farmers returned to their fields and worked diligently, and the golden wheat grew taller and taller.

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:28.920
The harvested grain was carried sack by sack into the granaries, piled as high as little mountains.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:38.664
The village market came alive; people happily bought and sold, and the children chased and played.

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:46.056
Emperor Jing succeeded to the throne and continued to let the people rest and recover, and the state treasury grew fuller day by day.

00:00:46.056 --> 00:00:49.472
Under the sunset, the village was quiet and beautiful.

00:00:49.472 --> 00:00:54.881
This time of peace and prosperity is called the 'Prosperity of Emperors Wen and Jing.'

